\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 # Y\'caU C\uc0\u7846 U THI\u7870 T K\u7870  WEB QU\u7842 N L\'cd N\u7896 P B\'c0I V\'c0 \u272 I\u7874 M H\u7884 C SINH\
\
C\'f4 Linh mu\uc0\u7889 n thi\u7871 t k\u7871  m\u7897 t trang web c\'f3 giao di\u7879 n nh\u7865  nh\'e0ng, th\'e2n thi\u7879 n, d\u7877  thao t\'e1c tr\'ean \u273 i\u7879 n tho\u7841 i \u273 \u7875  theo d\'f5i vi\u7879 c n\u7897 p b\'e0i, ch\u7845 m b\'e0i, s\u7917 a b\'e0i v\'e0 \u273 i\u7875 m c\u7911 a h\u7885 c sinh.\
\
## 1. Danh s\'e1ch h\uc0\u7885 c sinh v\'e0 m\'e3 c\'e1 nh\'e2n\
\
* Gi\'e1o vi\'ean c\'f3 th\uc0\u7875  nh\u7853 p ho\u7863 c t\u7843 i l\'ean danh s\'e1ch h\u7885 c sinh c\u7911 a l\u7899 p.\
* M\uc0\u7895 i h\u7885 c sinh c\'f3 m\u7897 t m\'e3 QR ri\'eang.\
* Tr\'ean m\'e3 QR hi\uc0\u7875 n th\u7883  r\'f5 h\u7885  t\'ean h\u7885 c sinh \u273 \u7875  tr\'e1nh qu\'e9t nh\u7847 m.\
* M\'e3 QR c\'f3 th\uc0\u7875  t\u7843 i xu\u7889 ng v\'e0 in ra \u273 \u7875  d\'e1n v\'e0o th\u7867  t\'ean, s\u7893  ho\u7863 c g\'f3c n\u7897 p b\'e0i.\
\
## 2. Danh s\'e1ch b\'e0i t\uc0\u7853 p\
\
Gi\'e1o vi\'ean c\'f3 th\uc0\u7875  t\u7841 o b\'e0i t\u7853 p m\u7899 i v\u7899 i c\'e1c th\'f4ng tin:\
\
* T\'ean b\'e0i t\uc0\u7853 p.\
* M\'f4n h\uc0\u7885 c.\
* Ng\'e0y giao b\'e0i.\
* H\uc0\u7841 n n\u7897 p.\
* Thang \uc0\u273 i\u7875 m.\
* Ghi ch\'fa n\uc0\u7871 u c\'f3.\
\
## 3. Ghi nh\uc0\u7853 n h\u7885 c sinh n\u7897 p b\'e0i\
\
Khi h\uc0\u7885 c sinh n\u7897 p b\'e0i:\
\
1. Gi\'e1o vi\'ean ho\uc0\u7863 c h\u7885 c sinh ch\u7885 n \u273 \'fang b\'e0i t\u7853 p.\
2. Qu\'e9t m\'e3 QR c\uc0\u7911 a h\u7885 c sinh.\
3. H\uc0\u7879  th\u7889 ng t\u7921  \u273 \u7897 ng l\u432 u:\
\
   * H\uc0\u7885  t\'ean h\u7885 c sinh.\
   * T\'ean b\'e0i t\uc0\u7853 p.\
   * Ng\'e0y v\'e0 gi\uc0\u7901  n\u7897 p.\
   * L\uc0\u7847 n n\u7897 p th\u7913  m\u7845 y.\
   * Tr\uc0\u7841 ng th\'e1i \'93\u272 \'e3 n\u7897 p\'94.\
\
H\uc0\u7879  th\u7889 ng t\u7921  x\'e1c \u273 \u7883 nh:\
\
* **N\uc0\u7897 p \u273 \'fang h\u7841 n:** n\u7897 p tr\u432 \u7899 c ho\u7863 c \u273 \'fang h\u7841 n.\
* **N\uc0\u7897 p tr\u7877 :** n\u7897 p sau th\u7901 i h\u7841 n.\
* **Ch\uc0\u432 a n\u7897 p:** ch\u432 a c\'f3 l\u432 \u7907 t qu\'e9t n\u7897 p b\'e0i.\
* **N\uc0\u7897 p l\u7841 i:** h\u7885 c sinh \u273 \'e3 n\u7897 p tr\u432 \u7899 c \u273 \'f3 v\'e0 ti\u7871 p t\u7909 c n\u7897 p sau khi s\u7917 a b\'e0i.\
\
Sau khi qu\'e9t th\'e0nh c\'f4ng, m\'e0n h\'ecnh c\uc0\u7847 n hi\u7879 n r\'f5 t\'ean h\u7885 c sinh, \u7843 nh \u273 \u7841 i di\u7879 n n\u7871 u c\'f3, tr\u7841 ng th\'e1i v\'e0 th\u7901 i gian n\u7897 p \u273 \u7875  ng\u432 \u7901 i qu\'e9t bi\u7871 t h\u7879  th\u7889 ng \u273 \'e3 ghi nh\u7853 n.\
\
## 4. Ch\uc0\u7845 m b\'e0i v\'e0 l\u432 u \u273 i\u7875 m\
\
Khi ch\uc0\u7845 m xong, gi\'e1o vi\'ean:\
\
1. Ch\uc0\u7885 n b\'e0i t\u7853 p \u273 ang ch\u7845 m.\
2. Qu\'e9t m\'e3 QR c\uc0\u7911 a h\u7885 c sinh.\
3. Nh\uc0\u7853 p \u273 i\u7875 m.\
4. Ch\uc0\u7885 n m\u7897 t trong c\'e1c k\u7871 t qu\u7843 :\
\
   * \uc0\u272 \'e3 \u273 \u7841 t.\
   * C\uc0\u7847 n s\u7917 a.\
   * C\uc0\u7847 n n\u7897 p l\u7841 i.\
   * Ch\uc0\u432 a ho\'e0n th\'e0nh.\
5. C\'f3 \'f4 ghi nh\uc0\u7853 n x\'e9t ng\u7855 n n\u7871 u c\u7847 n.\
\
H\uc0\u7879  th\u7889 ng l\u432 u \u273 \u7847 y \u273 \u7911 :\
\
* \uc0\u272 i\u7875 m c\u7911 a t\u7915 ng l\u7847 n ch\u7845 m.\
* Ng\'e0y v\'e0 gi\uc0\u7901  ch\u7845 m.\
* Nh\uc0\u7853 n x\'e9t c\u7911 a gi\'e1o vi\'ean.\
* Tr\uc0\u7841 ng th\'e1i b\'e0i l\'e0m.\
* Ng\uc0\u432 \u7901 i th\u7921 c hi\u7879 n thao t\'e1c.\
\
Kh\'f4ng ghi \uc0\u273 \'e8 \u273 i\u7875 m c\u361 . N\u7871 u h\u7885 c sinh s\u7917 a v\'e0 n\u7897 p l\u7841 i, h\u7879  th\u7889 ng ph\u7843 i l\u432 u th\'eam m\u7897 t l\u432 \u7907 t m\u7899 i \u273 \u7875  gi\'e1o vi\'ean xem \u273 \u432 \u7907 c to\'e0n b\u7897  qu\'e1 tr\'ecnh:\
\
**N\uc0\u7897 p l\u7847 n 1 \u8594  ch\u7845 m l\u7847 n 1 \u8594  y\'eau c\u7847 u s\u7917 a \u8594  n\u7897 p l\u7847 n 2 \u8594  ch\u7845 m l\u7841 i \u8594  ho\'e0n th\'e0nh.**\
\
## 5. Quy tr\'ecnh s\uc0\u7917 a b\'e0i v\'e0 n\u7897 p l\u7841 i\
\
Khi b\'e0i c\uc0\u7847 n s\u7917 a:\
\
* Gi\'e1o vi\'ean ch\uc0\u7885 n tr\u7841 ng th\'e1i \'93C\u7847 n s\u7917 a/N\u7897 p l\u7841 i\'94.\
* Khi h\uc0\u7885 c sinh s\u7917 a xong, gi\'e1o vi\'ean ho\u7863 c h\u7885 c sinh ch\u7881  c\u7847 n qu\'e9t l\u7841 i m\'e3 QR.\
* H\uc0\u7879  th\u7889 ng t\u7921  ghi nh\u7853 n \u273 \'e2y l\'e0 l\u7847 n n\u7897 p ti\u7871 p theo.\
* Gi\'e1o vi\'ean c\'f3 th\uc0\u7875  nh\u7853 p \u273 i\u7875 m m\u7899 i sau khi ch\u7845 m l\u7841 i.\
* H\uc0\u7879  th\u7889 ng v\u7851 n gi\u7919  \u273 i\u7875 m, nh\u7853 n x\'e9t v\'e0 th\u7901 i gian c\u7911 a c\'e1c l\u7847 n tr\u432 \u7899 c.\
\
