\fs22\fsmilli11250 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 ## 6. B\uc0\u7843 ng theo d\'f5i nhanh c\u7911 a t\u7915 ng b\'e0i\
\
M\uc0\u7895 i b\'e0i t\u7853 p c\u7847 n c\'f3 m\u7897 t b\u7843 ng g\u7891 m:\
\
* STT.\
* H\uc0\u7885  t\'ean h\u7885 c sinh.\
* Tr\uc0\u7841 ng th\'e1i hi\u7879 n t\u7841 i.\
* Th\uc0\u7901 i gian n\u7897 p g\u7847 n nh\u7845 t.\
* \uc0\u272 \'fang h\u7841 n hay tr\u7877  h\u7841 n.\
* S\uc0\u7889  l\u7847 n \u273 \'e3 n\u7897 p.\
* S\uc0\u7889  l\u7847 n ph\u7843 i l\'e0m l\u7841 i.\
* \uc0\u272 i\u7875 m l\u7847 n \u273 \u7847 u.\
* \uc0\u272 i\u7875 m g\u7847 n nh\u7845 t.\
* Nh\uc0\u7853 n x\'e9t.\
* N\'fat xem l\uc0\u7883 ch s\u7917 .\
\
C\'f3 th\uc0\u7875  l\u7885 c nhanh theo c\'e1c nh\'f3m:\
\
* Ch\uc0\u432 a n\u7897 p.\
* \uc0\u272 \'e3 n\u7897 p \u273 \'fang h\u7841 n.\
* N\uc0\u7897 p tr\u7877 .\
* \uc0\u272 ang c\u7847 n s\u7917 a.\
* \uc0\u272 \'e3 n\u7897 p l\u7841 i.\
* \uc0\u272 \'e3 ho\'e0n th\'e0nh.\
* Ch\uc0\u432 a \u273 \u7841 t y\'eau c\u7847 u.\
\
## 7. B\uc0\u7843 ng th\u7889 ng k\'ea t\u7893 ng h\u7907 p\
\
### Th\uc0\u7889 ng k\'ea theo t\u7915 ng h\u7885 c sinh\
\
* T\uc0\u7893 ng s\u7889  b\'e0i \u273 \u432 \u7907 c giao.\
* S\uc0\u7889  b\'e0i \u273 \'e3 n\u7897 p.\
* S\uc0\u7889  b\'e0i ch\u432 a n\u7897 p.\
* S\uc0\u7889  l\u7847 n n\u7897 p \u273 \'fang h\u7841 n.\
* S\uc0\u7889  l\u7847 n n\u7897 p tr\u7877 .\
* S\uc0\u7889  b\'e0i ph\u7843 i l\'e0m l\u7841 i.\
* T\uc0\u7893 ng s\u7889  l\u7847 n n\u7897 p l\u7841 i.\
* S\uc0\u7889  b\'e0i \u273 \'e3 ho\'e0n th\'e0nh.\
* S\uc0\u7889  b\'e0i ch\u432 a ho\'e0n th\'e0nh.\
* \uc0\u272 i\u7875 m trung b\'ecnh.\
* Qu\'e1 tr\'ecnh thay \uc0\u273 \u7893 i \u273 i\u7875 m sau khi s\u7917 a b\'e0i.\
* Danh s\'e1ch c\'e1c b\'e0i c\'f2n thi\uc0\u7871 u ho\u7863 c \u273 ang c\u7847 n s\u7917 a.\
\
### Th\uc0\u7889 ng k\'ea theo t\u7915 ng b\'e0i t\u7853 p\
\
* T\uc0\u7893 ng s\u7889  h\u7885 c sinh.\
* S\uc0\u7889  h\u7885 c sinh \u273 \'e3 n\u7897 p.\
* S\uc0\u7889  h\u7885 c sinh ch\u432 a n\u7897 p.\
* S\uc0\u7889  h\u7885 c sinh n\u7897 p \u273 \'fang h\u7841 n.\
* S\uc0\u7889  h\u7885 c sinh n\u7897 p tr\u7877 .\
* S\uc0\u7889  h\u7885 c sinh c\u7847 n s\u7917 a.\
* S\uc0\u7889  h\u7885 c sinh \u273 \'e3 n\u7897 p l\u7841 i.\
* S\uc0\u7889  h\u7885 c sinh \u273 \'e3 ho\'e0n th\'e0nh.\
* \uc0\u272 i\u7875 m trung b\'ecnh c\u7911 a l\u7899 p.\
\
### Th\uc0\u7889 ng k\'ea to\'e0n l\u7899 p\
\
* H\uc0\u7885 c sinh th\u432 \u7901 ng xuy\'ean n\u7897 p \u273 \u7911  v\'e0 \u273 \'fang h\u7841 n.\
* H\uc0\u7885 c sinh c\'f2n thi\u7871 u nhi\u7873 u b\'e0i.\
* H\uc0\u7885 c sinh th\u432 \u7901 ng xuy\'ean n\u7897 p tr\u7877 .\
* H\uc0\u7885 c sinh ph\u7843 i l\'e0m l\u7841 i nhi\u7873 u l\u7847 n.\
* H\uc0\u7885 c sinh c\'f3 ti\u7871 n b\u7897  sau khi s\u7917 a b\'e0i.\
* T\uc0\u7881  l\u7879  ho\'e0n th\'e0nh b\'e0i c\u7911 a c\u7843  l\u7899 p.\
\
## 8. H\uc0\u7891  s\u417  c\u7911 a t\u7915 ng h\u7885 c sinh\
\
Khi ch\uc0\u7885 n t\'ean m\u7897 t h\u7885 c sinh, gi\'e1o vi\'ean c\'f3 th\u7875  xem:\
\
* Danh s\'e1ch t\uc0\u7845 t c\u7843  b\'e0i \u273 \'e3 \u273 \u432 \u7907 c giao.\
* B\'e0i \uc0\u273 \'e3 n\u7897 p, ch\u432 a n\u7897 p ho\u7863 c n\u7897 p tr\u7877 .\
* \uc0\u272 i\u7875 m c\u7911 a t\u7915 ng b\'e0i.\
* S\uc0\u7889  l\u7847 n n\u7897 p c\u7911 a t\u7915 ng b\'e0i.\
* S\uc0\u7889  l\u7847 n ph\u7843 i s\u7917 a ho\u7863 c l\'e0m l\u7841 i.\
* Nh\uc0\u7853 n x\'e9t c\u7911 a gi\'e1o vi\'ean.\
* L\uc0\u7883 ch s\u7917  t\u7915 ng l\u7847 n n\u7897 p v\'e0 t\u7915 ng l\u7847 n ch\u7845 m.\
* Bi\uc0\u7875 u \u273 \u7891  ho\u7863 c ph\u7847 n t\u7893 ng k\u7871 t ti\u7871 n b\u7897  theo th\u7901 i gian.\
\
## 9. Xu\uc0\u7845 t v\'e0 l\u432 u d\u7919  li\u7879 u\
\
* C\'f3 th\uc0\u7875  xu\u7845 t b\u7843 ng th\u7889 ng k\'ea ra Excel ho\u7863 c Google Sheets.\
* C\'f3 th\uc0\u7875  xu\u7845 t b\'e1o c\'e1o c\u7911 a c\u7843  l\u7899 p ho\u7863 c ri\'eang m\u7897 t h\u7885 c sinh.\
* C\'f3 b\uc0\u7897  l\u7885 c theo m\'f4n h\u7885 c, b\'e0i t\u7853 p, h\u7885 c sinh v\'e0 kho\u7843 ng th\u7901 i gian.\
* D\uc0\u7919  li\u7879 u \u273 \u432 \u7907 c t\u7921  \u273 \u7897 ng l\u432 u sau m\u7895 i l\u7847 n qu\'e9t ho\u7863 c nh\u7853 p \u273 i\u7875 m.\
* C\'f3 ch\uc0\u7913 c n\u259 ng ch\u7881 nh s\u7917 a khi gi\'e1o vi\'ean qu\'e9t nh\u7847 m ho\u7863 c nh\u7853 p sai.\
* Ch\uc0\u7881  t\'e0i kho\u7843 n gi\'e1o vi\'ean m\u7899 i \u273 \u432 \u7907 c s\u7917 a \u273 i\u7875 m, x\'f3a l\u432 \u7907 t qu\'e9t ho\u7863 c thay \u273 \u7893 i d\u7919  li\u7879 u \u273 \'e3 l\u432 u.\
\
## 10. Y\'eau c\uc0\u7847 u v\u7873  giao di\u7879 n\
\
* Giao di\uc0\u7879 n nh\u7865  nh\'e0ng, s\'e1ng, th\'e2n thi\u7879 n v\'e0 d\u7877  nh\'ecn.\
* Ph\'f9 h\uc0\u7907 p v\u7899 i h\u7885 c sinh ti\u7875 u h\u7885 c nh\u432 ng kh\'f4ng qu\'e1 nhi\u7873 u chi ti\u7871 t g\'e2y r\u7889 i.\
* S\uc0\u7917  d\u7909 ng t\u7889 t tr\'ean \u273 i\u7879 n tho\u7841 i, m\'e1y t\'ednh b\u7843 ng v\'e0 m\'e1y t\'ednh.
