\fs22\fsmilli11250 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \cb3 * N\'fat qu\'e9t m\'e3 l\uc0\u7899 n, d\u7877  b\u7845 m.\
* Sau m\uc0\u7895 i l\u7847 n qu\'e9t ph\u7843 i c\'f3 th\'f4ng b\'e1o r\'f5 r\'e0ng:\
\
  * Qu\'e9t th\'e0nh c\'f4ng.\
  * \uc0\u272 \'e3 ghi nh\u7853 n n\u7897 p b\'e0i.\
  * \uc0\u272 \'e2y l\'e0 l\u7847 n n\u7897 p th\u7913  m\u7845 y.\
  * N\uc0\u7897 p \u273 \'fang h\u7841 n hay tr\u7877  h\u7841 n.\
* C\'f3 th\uc0\u7875  s\u7917  d\u7909 ng m\'e0u \u273 \u7875  nh\u7853 n bi\u7871 t nhanh:\
\
  * Xanh l\'e1: \uc0\u273 \'e3 ho\'e0n th\'e0nh.\
  * V\'e0ng: c\uc0\u7847 n s\u7917 a.\
  * Cam: n\uc0\u7897 p tr\u7877 .\
  * \uc0\u272 \u7887 : ch\u432 a n\u7897 p.\
  * Xanh d\uc0\u432 \u417 ng: \u273 \'e3 n\u7897 p l\u7841 i.\
\
## 11. \uc0\u272 i\u7873 u quan tr\u7885 ng nh\u7845 t\
\
Web c\uc0\u7847 n gi\'fap gi\'e1o vi\'ean thao t\'e1c th\u7853 t nhanh. V\u7899 i m\u7895 i l\u7847 n h\u7885 c sinh n\u7897 p b\'e0i, n\u7897 p l\u7841 i ho\u7863 c \u273 \u432 \u7907 c ch\u7845 m \u273 i\u7875 m, gi\'e1o vi\'ean ch\u7881  c\u7847 n:\
\
**Ch\uc0\u7885 n b\'e0i \u8594  qu\'e9t m\'e3 h\u7885 c sinh \u8594  ch\u7885 n tr\u7841 ng th\'e1i ho\u7863 c nh\u7853 p \u273 i\u7875 m \u8594  l\u432 u.**\
\
H\uc0\u7879  th\u7889 ng ph\u7843 i gi\u7919  \u273 \u432 \u7907 c to\'e0n b\u7897  l\u7883 ch s\u7917 , kh\'f4ng ghi \u273 \'e8 d\u7919  li\u7879 u c\u361 , \u273 \u7875  gi\'e1o vi\'ean theo d\'f5i ch\'ednh x\'e1c qu\'e1 tr\'ecnh ho\'e0n th\'e0nh v\'e0 ti\u7871 n b\u7897  c\u7911 a t\u7915 ng h\u7885 c sinh.
